      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 3:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shemaya navanakomana vake vaiti: Hatushi, Igari, Bharia, Nearia naShafati, vatanhatu vose pamwe chete.",
